        "original_id": "6008af36-9996-54dd-875d-bd0025cae1d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cartoon Network Too, Nick Jr. Too, Teletoon\n- Products: Skatoony\n- Topics: Overnight scheduling, reruns, channel launches\n\nFacts:\n- Cartoon Network Too launched on 24 April 2006.\n- Nick Jr. Too launched on 24 April 2006, the same day as rival channel Cartoon Network Too.\n- Cartoon Network Too usually aired older, lower-demand shows during overnight hours between midnight and 06:00.\n- Skatoony was one example of a show aired by Cartoon Network Too during those overnight hours.\n- Skatoony reruns are still occasionally shown on Teletoon in Canada.",
